	(text "nRF52840 stage TBD (module vs bare chip).\nNets waiting for the MCU: SDA SCL (I2C, pulled to +1V8), IMU_INT1 IMU_INT2,\nNPM_GPIO0_RESET NPM_GPIO1_INT, VBUSOUT (USB sense), USB_CC1 USB_CC2 + VBUS_IN\n(USB connector TBD), SWD.  Rails: VSYS (batt/USB), +1V8 = BUCK1 (VSET1 47k),\nVDD_SNS = LOADSW1-gated 1.8V sensor rail.  BUCK2 unused per nPM1300 PS Config 2:\nVOUT2 tied to VSYS (expected ERC power-output tie), SW2/PVSS2/VINLDO2 grounded,\nLSOUT2/VOUTLDO2 n/c, VSET2 grounded."
